  "content": {
    "id": "p13-q3",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "What is the relationship between $\\tan x$ and $\\tan(90^{\\circ}-x)$?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "They are reciprocals: $\\tan(90^{\\circ}-x)=\\dfrac{1}{\\tan x}$.",
      "worked": "From the triangle in Question 2,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\tan x&=\\frac{a}{c}\\\\\\tan(90^{\\circ}-x)&=\\frac{c}{a}\\\\\\tan x\\tan(90^{\\circ}-x)&=\\frac{a}{c}\\times\\frac{c}{a}=1\\end{align*}$$\nThey are reciprocals of each other.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
